flowchart TD
A[clerk signup] 
B1(prompt user for organization invite code)
B2(validate invite code)


c1{valid code ?}
c2(user redirected to error page allow continue signup)
c31(user retrys entering invite code)
c3(user continues signup without organization invite code)
c4(user added to default organization as guest)

d1(user continues signup with organization invite code)
d2(user added to organization as member)
d3(user redirected to welcome page)

B10(create user profile)
C(add user to organization)


    A -->|redirect to client| B1
    B1 --> B2
    B2 --> c1
    %% Decision: is the code valid?
    c1 -->|yes| d1
    c1 -->|no| c2 
    %% invlalid code path
    c2 --> c31
    c31 -.-> c1
    c31 --> c3
    c3 --> c4
    c4 --> B10

    %% valid code path
    d1 --> d2
    d2 --> d3
    d3 --> B10


    %% user profile creation and organization addition
    B10 --> C